# Nintendo_3DS_touch_HID.kl
#
# The current 3DS kernel driver is a direct, single-contact absolute
# touchscreen.  It advertises ABS_X 0..319, ABS_Y 0..239 and BTN_TOUCH; those
# events are consumed directly by Eclair's KeyInputQueue and need no key map.
#
# Keep this intentionally empty file so device-name lookup cannot fall back to
# obsolete virtual-keyboard mappings from the original bring-up driver.
